msgid ""
"Ansel manages your digital negatives in a database and lets you view them "
"through a lighttable. It also enables you to develop raw images and enhance "
"them in a darkroom."
msgstr ""

#: ../data/photos.ansel.Ansel.appdata.xml.in.h:3
msgid ""
